msgid "IfcRail"
msgstr "Rail"

msgid "IfcRail_DEFINITION"
msgstr "A rail is a predominately linear built element that has a special section profile. Rail is distinctive from built elements with similar geometric shapes (e.g. beam, member) that its major function is to ensure guidance of moving for vehicles or other kinds of machineries."

msgid "IfcTrackElement"
msgstr "Track Element"

msgid "IfcTrackElement_DEFINITION"
msgstr "A track element is a built element used specifically in the track domain in railway."

msgid "IfcRailway"
msgstr "Railway"

msgid "IfcRailway_DEFINITION"
msgstr "An [[IfcRailway]] is a spatial structure element as a route from one location to another for guided passage of wheeled vehicles on rails. An [[IfcRailway]] acts as a basic spatial structure element that supports to break down a railway project into manageable parts."

msgid "IfcRailwayPart"
msgstr "Railway Part"

msgid "IfcRailwayPart_DEFINITION"
msgstr "Part of a railway."

